{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-04-13 18:53:00', 'title': 'ABBVIE AND GENMAB ANNOUNCE TOPLINE RESULTS FOR EPCORITAMAB (DUOBODY®-CD3XCD20) FROM PHASE 1/2 TRIAL IN PATIENTS WITH RELAPSED/REFRACTORY LARGE B-CELL LYMPHOMA (LBCL)', 'text': "-\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 BASED ON TOPLINE RESULTS FROM THE EPCORE™ NHL-1 CLINICAL TRIAL, ABBVIE AND GENMAB WILL ENGAGE GLOBAL REGULATORY AUTHORITIES -\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 DATA FROM THE CLINICAL TRIAL TO BE PRESENTED AT A FUTURE MEDICAL MEETING -\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 LARGE B-CELL LYMPHOMA (LBCL) IS A COMMON FORM OF NON-HODGKIN'S LYMPHOMA (NHL) AND CURRENTLY HAS LIMITED TREATMENT OPTIONS NORTH CHICAGO, ILL. AND COPENHAGEN, DENMARK , APRIL 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBVIE (NYSE: ABBV) AND GENMAB A/S (NASDAQ: GMAB) TODAY ANNOUNCED TOPLINE RESULTS FROM THE FIRST COHORT OF THE EPCORE™ NHL-1 PHASE 1/2 CLINICAL TRIAL EVALUATING EPCORITAMAB (DUOBODY®-CD3XCD20), AN INVESTIGATIONAL SUBCUTANEOUS BISPECIFIC ANTIBODY."}{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-04-13 18:07:00', 'title': 'IMPORTANT INVESTOR REMINDER: KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP REMINDS ABBVIE, INC. INVESTORS OF DEADLINE IN SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH SIGNIFICANT LOSSES TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'RADNOR, PENNSYLVANIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - APRIL 13, 2022) - THE LAW FIRM OF KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP (WWW.KTMC.COM) INFORMS INVESTORS THAT THE FIRM HAS FILED A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ABBVIE, INC. (ABBVIE) (NYSE: ABBV) ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED ABBVIE SECURITIES BETWEEN APRIL 30, 2021, AND AUGUST 31, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). CLICK HERE TO SUBMIT YOUR ABBVIE LOSSES. YOU CAN ALSO CLICK...'}{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-04-13 17:26:00', 'title': 'GENMAB AND ABBVIE ANNOUNCE TOPLINE RESULTS FOR EPCORITAMAB (DUOBODY®-CD3XCD20) FROM PHASE 1/2 TRIAL IN PATIENTS WITH RELAPSED/REFRACTORY LARGE B-CELL LYMPHOMA (LBCL)', 'text': 'COPE